# Daily changelog (log/*.md, CHANGELOG.md's index) — excluded per user request 2026-09-02.
# Note: this is a deliberate exception to CLAUDE.md's changelog rule, which assumes log/ is
# tracked in git so a later session can open CHANGELOG.md and jump straight into log/<date>.md
# from git history alone. With this exclusion that only works locally, not from a fresh clone.
log/
